This repository is a private archive of inverter simulator code that was
translated from a local copy of the EPRI IEEE 2030.5 C client to Go.
The original C client is not open-source software and the team does
not have redistribution rights for either the original or this derivative.

This repository is retained solely as a personal reference for migration
planning purposes. Do not redistribute, publish, or relicense any portion
of this repository.

The replacement inverter simulator (clean-room implementation, based on
the IEEE 1547-2018 public specification with an OSS reference codebase)
lives in the public GRIDAPPSD/ieee-2030_5-go repository.
